  "slug": "coconut-oil-chocolate-mug-cake",
  "title": "Coconut Oil Chocolate Mug Cake",
  "blurb": "A quick single-serving chocolate cake made with coconut oil and chocolate chips, ready in minutes.",
  "steps": [
    "Melt the coconut oil in a microwave-safe mug for about 20 seconds.",
    "Add the chocolate chips to the warm oil and stir until mostly melted.",
    "Crack in the egg and whisk with a fork until smooth.",
    "Add the flour, sugar, salt and milk, then mix until no lumps remain.",
    "Microwave on high for 90 seconds to 2 minutes, until the cake has risen and set in the centre.",
    "Leave to cool for a minute before eating straight from the mug."
